  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The information submitted, in the absence of any conflicting evidence, is satisfactory to prove on the balance of probabilities that the existing flat within the rear extension at 65 High Street, Wealdstone, Harrow, HA3 5DQ has been in use as a self-contained residential unit for a continuous period of at least 4 years prior to the date of this application. As such, the existing development is immune from enforcement action and is therefore lawful under S.171B of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;"
